   "file": "content/FMA_7563/tier1.auto.md",
   "text": "Compartment of trunk, which is embryologically derived from the intraembryonic celom; is located in the trunk, is enclosed by the body wall; contains serous sacs, viscera and other organs. Examples: There is only one body cavity.",
